WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:20.243
<v Host>Welcome to Japanese Daily News. I'm Maya. Today is June thirteenth. Yesterday, Elon Musk's rocket company SpaceX went public on the American stock market, and it raised about twelve trillion yen — the largest amount in history. Let's listen.

00:00:20.844 --> 00:00:23.603
<v News>今日のニュースです。

00:00:24.303 --> 00:00:34.359
<v News>アメリカの会社「スペースX」が、6月12日にアメリカの株式市場に上場しました。

00:00:35.060 --> 00:00:41.972
<v News>この上場で集めたお金の金額は、約12兆円でした。

00:00:42.671 --> 00:00:49.463
<v News>これは、世界の歴史の中で、いちばん大きな金額です。

00:00:50.164 --> 00:00:58.515
<v News>スペースXは、ロケットを使って、人や荷物を宇宙に運ぶ会社です。

00:00:59.216 --> 00:01:06.224
<v News>イーロン・マスクさんがつくった会社で、世界でとても有名です。

00:01:06.924 --> 00:01:15.299
<v News>また、「スターリンク」という、宇宙からインターネットを届けるサービスもしています。

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:23.680
<v News>集めたお金は、新しいロケットやAIの開発に使う予定です。

00:01:24.379 --> 00:01:33.403
<v News>上場した日、株の値段は、最初の値段より11%高くなりました。

00:01:34.103 --> 00:01:40.248
<v News>多くの投資家が、この会社のこれからに期待しています。

00:01:40.947 --> 00:01:42.579
<v Host>Let's break it down.

00:01:43.180 --> 00:01:54.676
<v Slow>アメリカの会社「スペースX」が、6月12日にアメリカの株式市場に上場しました。

00:01:55.475 --> 00:02:01.596
<v Host>The American company SpaceX was listed on the American stock market on June twelfth.

00:02:02.195 --> 00:02:04.596
<v Vocab>上場

00:02:04.995 --> 00:02:13.804
<v Host>It means listing — when a company's shares start trading on the stock market for the first time. This is the big moment everyone was waiting for.

00:02:14.403 --> 00:02:22.324
<v Slow>この上場で集めたお金の金額は、約12兆円でした。

00:02:23.123 --> 00:02:27.515
<v Host>The amount of money raised through this listing was about twelve trillion yen.

00:02:28.116 --> 00:02:30.491
<v Vocab>金額

00:02:30.891 --> 00:02:40.515
<v Host>It means amount of money — a sum. The first character means gold or money, the second means a quantity, so together, how much money.

00:02:41.116 --> 00:02:48.867
<v Slow>これは、世界の歴史の中で、いちばん大きな金額です。

00:02:49.668 --> 00:02:53.484
<v Host>This is the largest amount in the history of the world.

00:02:54.084 --> 00:02:56.412
<v Vocab>歴史

00:02:56.812 --> 00:03:04.996
<v Host>It means history. You'll see it in news, in school subjects, and in phrases like the biggest in history, just like here.

00:03:05.596 --> 00:03:15.147
<v Slow>スペースXは、ロケットを使って、人や荷物を宇宙に運ぶ会社です。

00:03:15.948 --> 00:03:21.467
<v Host>SpaceX is a company that uses rockets to carry people and cargo into space.

00:03:22.068 --> 00:03:24.276
<v Vocab>宇宙

00:03:24.675 --> 00:03:32.092
<v Host>It means space, or the universe. Think of rockets, stars, and astronauts — all part of this word.

00:03:32.692 --> 00:03:40.683
<v Slow>イーロン・マスクさんがつくった会社で、世界でとても有名です。

00:03:41.484 --> 00:03:47.003
<v Host>It's a company founded by Elon Musk, and it's very famous around the world.

00:03:47.604 --> 00:03:49.836
<v Vocab>有名

00:03:50.235 --> 00:03:59.116
<v Host>It means famous, well-known. It's a na-adjective, so to describe a noun you add na — a famous person, a famous place.

00:03:59.716 --> 00:04:09.292
<v Slow>また、「スターリンク」という、宇宙からインターネットを届けるサービスもしています。

00:04:10.092 --> 00:04:15.300
<v Host>It also runs a service called Starlink, which delivers internet from space.

00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:18.276
<v Vocab>届ける

00:04:18.675 --> 00:04:26.572
<v Host>It means to deliver, to get something to someone. The mail, a package, or here, an internet signal from space.

00:04:27.172 --> 00:04:35.956
<v Slow>集めたお金は、新しいロケットやAIの開発に使う予定です。

00:04:36.755 --> 00:04:41.339
<v Host>The money raised is planned to be used for developing new rockets and AI.

00:04:41.939 --> 00:04:44.387
<v Vocab>開発

00:04:44.788 --> 00:04:52.684
<v Host>It means development — creating something new, like new technology or products. Companies do a lot of this word.

00:04:53.283 --> 00:05:03.579
<v Slow>上場した日、株の値段は、最初の値段より11%高くなりました。

00:05:04.379 --> 00:05:10.259
<v Host>On the day of the listing, the share price rose eleven percent above the starting price.

00:05:10.860 --> 00:05:12.947
<v Vocab>値段

00:05:13.348 --> 00:05:19.636
<v Host>It means price — how much something costs. You'll hear it shopping, and in markets like this one.

